    {
      "id": "intro-vue-cli-vite",
      "title": "Introduction to Vue Project Setup",
      "type": "content",
      "duration": "2m",
      "content": "<p>Modern Vue.js development relies heavily on build tools like Vite or Vue CLI. Vite is the recommended tool for its lightning-fast Hot Module Replacement (HMR) and optimized build process.</p>\n<pre><code>npm create vue@latest</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "id": "vite-mcq",
