    {
      "id": "env-variables-content",
      "title": "Environment Variables in Vite",
      "type": "content",
      "duration": "2m",
      "content": "<p>Vite exposes env variables through the <code>import.meta.env</code> object. To prevent accidental leaks, only variables prefixed with <code>VITE_</code> are exposed to your client-side code.</p>\n<pre><code>console.log(import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL);</code></pre>"
    }
